+          <div class="reveal" data-delay="1">
+            <p>I've spent more than five years chasing the perfect light, using it to tell the unique story of those before me — a frame at a time, a moment as it unfolds.</p>
+            <p>Based in Ibadan, I work with clients across Nigeria and internationally — from facelifting headshot sessions to momentous occasions of birth, milestones, and everything in between. Every shoot begins with a conversation, because great photography starts with understanding who you are.</p>
