+            <div class="faq-a"><div><p>Sleep well, hydrate, and bring one or two outfits that feel unmistakably like you. Arrive a few minutes early so we can ease in — and because every shoot begins with a conversation, we'll already have talked through mood, location, and looks before the day.</p></div></div>
+          </div>
+          <div class="faq-item">
